          "key": "name",
          "value": "Service Boundary and Gateway Contract"
        },
        {
          "stable_id": "bbbc5f7d-fcb6-4373-9a5f-193b84ddfc0f",
          "type": "string",
          "key": "description",
          "value": "Define LMRS as a separate local-model runtime service, establish its provider-gateway boundary, and describe the canonical request flow between the gateway and the adapter-facing service. This step also fixes the MVP envelope and the top-level invariant that oversized prompts are blocked before runtime execution."
        },
